{"2817760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yokai Tales: Fox", "steam_appid": 2817760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the humans found that harnessing spirit souls could power their Silkpunk machines, the world changed forever. Now, being a Yokai roaming the land is a death sentence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your kin’s survival. Each rescue not only saves a soul but also strengthens you, unlocking new abilities to move faster, explore further, and strike back with greater force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/1451953204d73d12dd364c444ebe1af0.avif?t=1784283041\" width=625 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/bd7cb6a48e64ad44cab824d29329d237.poster.avif?t=1784283041\" width=625 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/bd7cb6a48e64ad44cab824d29329d237.webm?t=1784283041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on walls, vault over obstacles, and flip through the air with fluid, responsive parkour. Every element in the environment can be kicked, climbed, swung from, and used to keep your momentum alive. Turn movement into a tactical weapon as parkour flows seamlessly into stylish combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/a9495b110e49220aab6c770abeffc086.avif?t=1784283041\" width=625 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/e633577299a984ec7fd68dc4281b0aec.poster.avif?t=1784283041\" width=625 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/e633577299a984ec7fd68dc4281b0aec.webm?t=1784283041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat flows like a dance, where every dodge &amp; counter keeps you in motion. Gather magical weapons given by Yokai and Awaken their powerful movement actions to trick or juggle your opponents into submission. Stylish maneuvers and fluid parkour turn every encounter into a high-speed performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/53f487c1ab64bbd6e0747cc0eb5094ba.avif?t=1784283041\" width=625 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/b02d56013a61bb83583e9444534ebff9.poster.avif?t=1784283041\" width=625 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817760/extras/b02d56013a61bb83583e9444534ebff9.webm?t=1784283041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>Yokai Tales: Fox</i>, every corner is built for wonder and discovery. Its landscapes may be harsh, but they’re yours to conquer through fluid parkour and boundless freedom of movement. Running, leaping, and climbing 